SF0114 Missing persons-reporting requirement.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Landen and Cooper and Representative(s)
Brown, L, Clouston, Geringer, Lawley, Lien and Washut
AN ACT relating to criminal procedure; requiring the acceptance of reports of
missing persons by law enforcement as specified; providing exceptions;
specifying duties for law enforcement agencies and peace officers related to
missing persons; making conforming amendments; and providing for an effective
date.
